(7156688, 1097818, 58667, '<td valign="top">I would like to see what the other 2 cameras captured too... :) An interesting moment! The blown out sky is a little unfortunate, but what can you do?</td>', 'I would like to see what the other 2 cameras captured too... :) An interesting moment! The blown out sky is a little unfortunate, but what can you do?', '2014-01-13 05:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7156690, 1097697, 58667, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot because the lady caught you out - there''s something about the acknowledgement of the photographer in otherwise candid photography that I like. It gives me a sense of interaction, which is so lacking in society. To me this shows this lack of interaction well.</td>', 'I like this a lot because the lady caught you out - there''s something about the acknowledgement of the photographer in otherwise candid photography that I like. It gives me a sense of interaction, which is so lacking in society. To me this shows this lack of interaction well.', '2014-01-13 05:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7156691, 1097107, 58667, '<td valign="top">Exactly! lol. People are so afraid of cameras.</td>', 'Exactly! lol. People are so afraid of cameras.', '2014-01-13 05:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7156696, 1097625, 155317, '<td valign="top">Nice catch, wonder what they are looking at</td>', 'Nice catch, wonder what they are looking at', '2014-01-13 05:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7156697, 1097300, 155317, '<td valign="top">I can''t help but look at that tree</td>', 'I can''t help but look at that tree', '2014-01-13 05:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7156698, 1097243, 155317, '<td valign="top">Staged? Great pov and lighting for a night shot. One of my favs</td>', 'Staged? Great pov and lighting for a night shot. One of my favs', '2014-01-13 05:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7156699, 1097541, 155317, '<td valign="top">What a nice spot to shoot</td>', 'What a nice spot to shoot', '2014-01-13 05:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7156700, 1097107, 155317, '<td valign="top">Haha, nice to see I''m not the only one getting the "look" excellent moment to capture</td>', 'Haha, nice to see I''m not the only one getting the "look" excellent moment to capture', '2014-01-13 05:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7156701, 1097428, 155317, '<td valign="top">Creative, I enjoy your pov</td>', 'Creative, I enjoy your pov', '2014-01-13 05:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7156702, 1097757, 58667, '<td valign="top">Great capture of this moment! And thank you for keeping it in colour! I would have like it more sharp, but I don''t expect a photo like this to be sharp (in other words I''m not taking off any points for any lack of sharpness).</td>', 'Great capture of this moment! And thank you for keeping it in colour! I would have like it more sharp, but I don''t expect a photo like this to be sharp (in other words I''m not taking off any points for any lack of sharpness).', '2014-01-13 05:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7156704, 1097606, 58667, '<td valign="top">Lovely wave - really friendly photo! :) People seem serious and unapproachable at first, but then they surprise you. I took a photo of a homeless guy who does karate moves on a log fence as one of my outtakes. He noticed me :/, but then was all friendly :).</td>', 'Lovely wave - really friendly photo! :) People seem serious and unapproachable at first, but then they surprise you. I took a photo of a homeless guy who does karate moves on a log fence as one of my outtakes. He noticed me :/, but then was all friendly :).', '2014-01-13 05:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7156711, 1097772, 58667, '<td valign="top">I love the expression captured!</td>', 'I love the expression captured!', '2014-01-13 06:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7156712, 1097836, 58667, '<td valign="top">What I like about this is the amount of stuff happening in one shot, and this busy-ness is in the background of the story.</td>', 'What I like about this is the amount of stuff happening in one shot, and this busy-ness is in the background of the story.', '2014-01-13 06:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7156713, 1097625, 58667, '<td valign="top">And it''s the white dog that makes the photo! :)</td>', 'And it''s the white dog that makes the photo! :)', '2014-01-13 06:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7156715, 1097791, 58667, '<td valign="top">I''m not one for this much close up with little context because I can''t map out the moment clearly. But the angle on this is really good and the fact that it''s right up in the subject''s space is very bold. There is content here and not just a close up of a random stranger, so that''s good.</td>', 'I''m not one for this much close up with little context because I can''t map out the moment clearly. But the angle on this is really good and the fact that it''s right up in the subject''s space is very bold. There is content here and not just a close up of a random stranger, so that''s good.', '2014-01-13 06:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7156716, 1097268, 58667, '<td valign="top">Although the contrast is very high, the wheel is clearly visible, which is definitely a very good thing here. And this is quite wide - it seems you were close to the subject. Are these people you know? The expression of the child in the door is well visible - that''s a great plus.</td>', 'Although the contrast is very high, the wheel is clearly visible, which is definitely a very good thing here. And this is quite wide - it seems you were close to the subject. Are these people you know? The expression of the child in the door is well visible - that''s a great plus.', '2014-01-13 06:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7156719, 1097773, 58667, '<td valign="top">The foot is almost too much or too little - it gives some context, but not enough. Perhaps it could have been better not in? I''m just thinking out aloud... :) I like this composition - I get a good sense of what''s going on. I personally prefer shorter focal lengths for this type of photo (or am I wrong and you are using a short length here?). The reason is the compression which results in less depth when using a longer length. But that''s my preference. I like the photo. Oh, and the foot is interesting.</td>', 'The foot is almost too much or too little - it gives some context, but not enough. Perhaps it could have been better not in? I''m just thinking out aloud... :) I like this composition - I get a good sense of what''s going on. I personally prefer shorter focal lengths for this type of photo (or am I wrong and you are using a short length here?). The reason is the compression which results in less depth when using a longer length. But that''s my preference. I like the photo. Oh, and the foot is interesting.', '2014-01-13 06:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7156720, 1097714, 58667, '<td valign="top">I like this because you really highlight the cold. The coffee on the left, the fur in the middle and the lady on the right who is clearly under-dressed for these freezing temperatures! :) And the snow. It looks really cold.</td>', 'I like this because you really highlight the cold. The coffee on the left, the fur in the middle and the lady on the right who is clearly under-dressed for these freezing temperatures! :) And the snow. It looks really cold.', '2014-01-13 06:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7156722, 1097541, 58667, '<td valign="top">The lady leaning on the sign is a really strong point. I like the context and the amount of story contained here. The only thing which I''m marking down on is the missing main subject - there isn''t a clear "this is what I''m documenting here". That''s just my view. I''m probably missing something.</td>', 'The lady leaning on the sign is a really strong point. I like the context and the amount of story contained here. The only thing which I''m marking down on is the missing main subject - there isn''t a clear "this is what I''m documenting here". That''s just my view. I''m probably missing something.', '2014-01-13 06:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7156723, 1097806, 58667, '<td valign="top">Interesting capture of the man. Is he trying to dodge the frame? lol. This looks really close and personal.</td>', 'Interesting capture of the man. Is he trying to dodge the frame? lol. This looks really close and personal.', '2014-01-13 06:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7156724, 1097216, 58667, '<td valign="top">This is tightly framed, but I like what is shown.</td>', 'This is tightly framed, but I like what is shown.', '2014-01-13 06:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7156727, 1097784, 58667, '<td valign="top">At first I didn''t like this too much - the "negative space" on the right is very heavy. But I''ve looked at it more and the composition is very clever. It is heavy on the right and feels overwhelming, but it does give that sense of being there. One thing I may have liked more is for the person to be a bit closer. He almost feels like part of the background.<br/> <br/>I''m guessing this is Mark Wiley? This looks like the same place as <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1096294" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">The sun low and weak</a> :)</td>', 'At first I didn''t like this too much - the "negative space" on the right is very heavy. But I''ve looked at it more and the composition is very clever. It is heavy on the right and feels overwhelming, but it does give that sense of being there. One thing I may have liked more is for the person to be a bit closer. He almost feels like part of the background. I''m guessing this is Mark Wiley? This looks like the same place as The sun low and weak :)', '2014-01-13 06:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7156974, 1097691, 174262, '<td valign="top">Beautiful :)</td>', 'Beautiful :)', '2014-01-13 16:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7156996, 1097757, 155317, '<td valign="top">very interesting photo- from the subject to the background.</td>', 'very interesting photo- from the subject to the background.', '2014-01-13 17:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7156997, 1097818, 155317, '<td valign="top">wonderful title and capture</td>', 'wonderful title and capture', '2014-01-13 17:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7157001, 1097715, 155317, '<td valign="top">bump, coming back to comment and realizing that''s a pig! Guess I should have looked harder (and read your title, lol). That''s what a street photographer strives to capture... image with character!</td>', 'bump, coming back to comment and realizing that''s a pig! Guess I should have looked harder (and read your title, lol). That''s what a street photographer strives to capture... image with character!', '2014-01-13 17:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7157004, 1097791, 155317, '<td valign="top">tough to have a camera in hand and get such a close up.  Nice. The face says so much!</td>', 'tough to have a camera in hand and get such a close up.  Nice. The face says so much!', '2014-01-13 18:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7157099, 1097534, 155317, '<td valign="top">love the narrow pathway and the shadow. Great photo</td>', 'love the narrow pathway and the shadow. Great photo', '2014-01-13 21:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7157239, 1097697, 144365, '<td valign="top">10<br/>I love when someone interacts with the photographer. Here, she just happened to peek over, almost like she was trying to figure out where that mysterious song was coming from, and BAM, you''re there snapping away.</td>', '10I love when someone interacts with the photographer. Here, she just happened to peek over, almost like she was trying to figure out where that mysterious song was coming from, and BAM, you''re there snapping away.', '2014-01-14 09:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7157240, 1097517, 144365, '<td valign="top">9<br/>There''s actually a story in this image unlike the vast majority of other entries.</td>', '9There''s actually a story in this image unlike the vast majority of other entries.', '2014-01-14 09:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7157241, 1097832, 144365, '<td valign="top">8<br/>Obviously! Let''s go get some latkes.</td>', '8Obviously! Let''s go get some latkes.', '2014-01-14 09:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7157242, 1097791, 144365, '<td valign="top">7<br/>Guessing this is bvy. I love these random snapshots of people doing their thing.</td>', '7Guessing this is bvy. I love these random snapshots of people doing their thing.', '2014-01-14 09:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7157246, 1097753, 144365, '<td valign="top">8<br/>Really wish the person getting their hair cut had their face in the photo. Otherwise it''s a very good capture.</td>', '8Really wish the person getting their hair cut had their face in the photo. Otherwise it''s a very good capture.', '2014-01-14 09:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7157247, 1097534, 144365, '<td valign="top">6<br/>Way above my average for this challenge. Assuming this is jagar. There''s a story missing from this photo which your entries normally have.</td>', '6Way above my average for this challenge. Assuming this is jagar. There''s a story missing from this photo which your entries normally have.', '2014-01-14 09:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7157362, 1097729, 60173, '<td valign="top">I thought I''d play the game of "can I find this on Google??" As it turns out, I can! I "drove" up a couple blocks to Marquette and some guy is flipping the Google car off! You have some unfriendly neighbors my friend...</td>', 'I thought I''d play the game of "can I find this on Google??" As it turns out, I can! I "drove" up a couple blocks to Marquette and some guy is flipping the Google car off! You have some unfriendly neighbors my friend...', '2014-01-14 15:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
