(7158605, 1097243, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very enjoyable and intriguing film noir image.  Beautifully lit amid all the darkness.  The guard rails are paid loving attention as well as serving as a frame.  The signage and bright lights seem to shed information, but really don''t.  The encounter itself is literally part of the background, hinting at a cold war border crossing.  I even love the paper in the left foreground.  A personal favorite.</td>', 'Very enjoyable and intriguing film noir image.  Beautifully lit amid all the darkness.  The guard rails are paid loving attention as well as serving as a frame.  The signage and bright lights seem to shed information, but really don''t.  The encounter itself is literally part of the background, hinting at a cold war border crossing.  I even love the paper in the left foreground.  A personal favorite.', '2014-01-16 23:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
