(7158865, 1097784, 12611, '<td valign="top">I love how you achieved the cold raw day feel of a street shot on the left, the unsettling gray, the perfectly overexposed sky, and yet, on the right, all the frenetic energy of a train station night shot with starkly deeper contrast. Congrats on the ribbon as well.</td>', 'I love how you achieved the cold raw day feel of a street shot on the left, the unsettling gray, the perfectly overexposed sky, and yet, on the right, all the frenetic energy of a train station night shot with starkly deeper contrast. Congrats on the ribbon as well.', '2014-01-17 08:34:11.000000', NULL, 0),
