(7158899, 1097358, 30364, '<td valign="top">t''would''ve been my hero had I looked during voting.  But I''m looking only now, and it is anyway.  Another 10 would have made bugger all difference anyway.<br/> <br/>I sometimes wonder if I''m sad or glad that most folks here don''t grasp just how good your stuff is.  Probably glad, on balance.  Think what an unholy balls-up a DPC challenge called, "In the style of Nick Hinch" would be.  But there could be only one entry, really.  Cheers, big ears.</td>', 't''would''ve been my hero had I looked during voting.  But I''m looking only now, and it is anyway.  Another 10 would have made bugger all difference anyway. I sometimes wonder if I''m sad or glad that most folks here don''t grasp just how good your stuff is.  Probably glad, on balance.  Think what an unholy balls-up a DPC challenge called, "In the style of Nick Hinch" would be.  But there could be only one entry, really.  Cheers, big ears.', '2014-01-17 10:15:46.000000', NULL, 0),
