(7158977, 1097534, 19825, '<td valign="top">Minimal does not slow you down. I wonder if you had your in camera processing settings specific for this image or just your normal street settings. I love the high contrast image, small detail in the hair and purse, and the tilt of the head. (p.s., I picked up an x100s to carry around. Now we will see if I can do anything worthwhile with it). Nice job in making Minimal look easy.</td>', 'Minimal does not slow you down. I wonder if you had your in camera processing settings specific for this image or just your normal street settings. I love the high contrast image, small detail in the hair and purse, and the tilt of the head. (p.s., I picked up an x100s to carry around. Now we will see if I can do anything worthwhile with it). Nice job in making Minimal look easy.', '2014-01-17 12:39:59.000000', NULL, 0),
