(7160568, 1097300, 68504, '<td valign="top">don''t beat yourself up. the elements are so incredibly strong, and the light is Hockneyic. And yet it is a relief <i>from</i> Hockney hisself. And it is candid/street. I wish I had seen all this when I voted. (and the K-01 - I like it more and more, but the shot-to-shot or burst-to-burst is certainly the molasses it''s said to be).</td>', 'don''t beat yourself up. the elements are so incredibly strong, and the light is Hockneyic. And yet it is a relief from Hockney hisself. And it is candid/street. I wish I had seen all this when I voted. (and the K-01 - I like it more and more, but the shot-to-shot or burst-to-burst is certainly the molasses it''s said to be).', '2014-01-21 14:20:45.000000', NULL, 0),
