(7160810, 1097652, 170018, '<td valign="top">I apologize for such a late reply! Was away for few days.<br/>Thank you all so much!!! <br/>Sorry, <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=144365" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Venser</a>, for depriving the proper placement for your excellent photo (I loved that woman''s look).<br/>Robert, thank you for the invitation! Be careful, it might be too tempting!!! :-)<br/>Scott, would be great to meet, just don''t forget to wear you rubber bands. You''ll recognize me easily, I''m at this place at 8.30 almost every morning, stalking commuters with the camera (ever since this challenge I''m exercising my ability to take photos of the strangers. It''s SO hard!)</td>', 'I apologize for such a late reply! Was away for few days.Thank you all so much!!! Sorry,  Venser, for depriving the proper placement for your excellent photo (I loved that woman''s look).Robert, thank you for the invitation! Be careful, it might be too tempting!!! :-)Scott, would be great to meet, just don''t forget to wear you rubber bands. You''ll recognize me easily, I''m at this place at 8.30 almost every morning, stalking commuters with the camera (ever since this challenge I''m exercising my ability to take photos of the strangers. It''s SO hard!)', '2014-01-21 23:25:09.000000', NULL, 0),
